        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 25 at 7:27PM MDT by NWS Great Falls MT</headline>
        <description>Westerly winds gusting between 40 and 50 mph are leading to areas
of blowing dust across the Helena Valley this evening. Drivers
should be prepared for changing conditions over short distances.

If you encounter blowing dust and subsequent reduced visibility,
slow down and turn on your hazards.
</description>
